<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 18.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 18.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 200,000 shares in Polifarb Wroclaw SA at 18 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Polifarb Wroclaw was trading at 18.7 zlotys in 112,169 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
